   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Human Rights Development Initiative (HRDI), based in Pretoria, promotes Human Rights Law Clinics (university based practical case law providing legal aid to underpriviledged populations) to increase Access to Justice for Vulnerable Groups in Africa. Project runs Jan2006 to Dec2008, in Southern Africa and Great Lakes region Sida/DESA supported HRDI&apos;s start-up phase 2004-2005.</narrative>
